WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.620
Vadim Selyeznov wants to be good.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.149
Good for his new life.

00:00:06.149 --> 00:00:08.630
He trains hard, several times a day.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:13.350
Sport is one way of breaking with the past.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.450
Forever.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:26.460
"I stole a car and had an accident.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.460
And I ran off.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.910
The police caught me two days later."

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:38.010
Vadim has been at this facility for juvenile
offenders in Serafimovka for two years.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.420
Many of the boys here are similar to him.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.700
They struggled on the outside.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.469
They stole cars, beat people up, took drugs.

00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:47.780
Some of them even committed murder.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:52.390
But they've found a balance here, a routine.

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:57.379
"Outside where they're free, they're potentially
dangerous.

00:00:57.379 --> 00:01:00.230
Dangerous for other children from decent families.

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:03.020
Teachers don't know how to deal with them.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.830
The other kids are well-dressed, well-fed.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.260
They know their parents are waiting for them
at home.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.790
These ones on the other hand don't even know
what to wear to school.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.190
They don't have nice clothes like the others.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.920
That makes them aggressive.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:19.740
Here everyone looks the same."

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.780
Vadim has lunchtime duty today.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:31.850
They seem to get enough to eat in this institution
- soup, meat, dessert.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:36.820
Vadim's team lays the table.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:49.470
Life is easier if there is routine and order,
clear rules and discipline.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:02:00.360
"Spasibo"
"I was a terror.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.680
I was constantly fighting with other boys.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:08.200
I've changed completely here."

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:10.890
Some of the children here are orphans.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:14.459
Many others are the children of alcoholics,
drug addicts.

00:02:14.459 --> 00:02:17.879
Some parents are in jail.

00:02:17.879 --> 00:02:22.349
The general idea is that boys like Vadim should
improve their behavior.

00:02:22.349 --> 00:02:26.310
And ideally become soldiers.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:31.590
"We require the same of everybody.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:34.769
The bed has to be made like this, it's like
an envelope.

00:02:34.769 --> 00:02:36.409
it should look perfect.

00:02:36.409 --> 00:02:37.409
Like this.

00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:39.400
Very tight.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.499
This is a boys' school.

00:02:40.499 --> 00:02:43.760
We're preparing them for the army.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.119
This is not a prison."

00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:51.650
(
And the system works.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.260
Many boys go into the army from Sarafimovka,
where they are taught to be patriotic servers

00:02:56.260 --> 00:03:04.349
of the state, not responsible and critical
citizens who question the government's authority.

00:03:04.349 --> 00:03:07.919
The boys are taught that they should be grateful
for a second chance.

00:03:07.919 --> 00:03:22.640
And many are of course grateful for the affection
and care they receive here.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:26.930
Many of the tutors here are certain that they
are doing Vadim and other boys like him a

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.419
lot of good.

00:03:29.419 --> 00:03:43.559
"Our children radiate warmth and we feel it,
but they also need warmth back.

00:03:43.559 --> 00:03:50.870
Some of them like their hair to be stroked
- even the big boys like Vadim.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.569
Others tell us their secrets.

00:03:53.569 --> 00:03:55.569
It shows that they trust us.

00:03:55.569 --> 00:04:00.989
And to earn the trust of hard cases like this
is saying something."

00:04:00.989 --> 00:04:06.579
There is a fence around the facility to prevent
boys from escaping.

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:13.030
But Vadim says that nobody here would want
to escape.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:16.750
"I wasn't allowed to leave for the first three
months.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:21.799
But after I'd adapted, I was allowed out on
day release from time to time.

00:04:21.799 --> 00:04:24.790
I never thought of escaping though.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.139
They treat us well here."

00:04:28.139 --> 00:04:33.800
Several thousand boys have gone through this
facility since it opened in the 1970s.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.639
They're mainly from surrounding towns in Bashkortostan.

00:04:37.639 --> 00:04:40.910
But there are such re-education facilities
all over Russia.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:48.560
"It would be great if the children could simply
stay here.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:52.930
But they have to leave the facility one day.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:59.409
And they often go back to where they came,
to the same conditions.

00:04:59.409 --> 00:05:11.990
Only those who learn to stand their ground
here manage to survive those conditions."

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:18.669
Boys who end up at Serafimovka quickly understand
that life is sometimes easier behind a fence.

00:05:18.669 --> 00:05:22.710
The mixture of discipline and care here is
not typical for the Russian judicial system

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:29.400
- a system that boys like Vadim are often
acquainted with from an early age.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.919
There are surely problems here.

00:05:31.919 --> 00:05:37.300
But the show for our cameras was one of an
ideal state reeducation facility with grateful,

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.279
disciplined boys.

